{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19108290","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19108290","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1910829001:1":{"text":"你说的是真的，<style=highlight>降格<...","source_cn":"你说的是真的，<style=highlight>降格<...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910829002:1":{"text":"舍弃神格，舍弃权柄，舍弃自我，舍弃我们之所以为我们的东...","source_cn":"舍弃神格，舍弃权柄，舍弃自我，舍弃我们之所以为我们的东...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910829003:1":{"text":"如果那<style=highlight>能让神明避免堕...","source_cn":"如果那<style=highlight>能让神明避免堕...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910829004:1":{"text":"亲爱的妹妹，你总是把凡人的挣扎放在心里，也把凡人的恐惧...","source_cn":"亲爱的妹妹，你总是把凡人的挣扎放在心里，也把凡人的恐惧...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910829005:1":{"text":"神会堕落，是因为我们被原罪侵染，我已经用自己的权能逃脱...","source_cn":"神会堕落，是因为我们被原罪侵染，我已经用自己的权能逃脱...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910829006:1":{"text":"你惧怕成为凡人吗，奥汐娜？你将自己拆成碎片，历经数个复...","source_cn":"你惧怕成为凡人吗，奥汐娜？你将自己拆成碎片，历经数个复...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910829007:1":{"text":"你所繁育出的碎片的确存在，他们经历着真实的痛苦和幸福，...","source_cn":"你所繁育出的碎片的确存在，他们经历着真实的痛苦和幸福，...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910829008:1":{"text":"他们若真是你，本该可以运用繁育的力量自行诞下子嗣。但他...","source_cn":"他们若真是你，本该可以运用繁育的力量自行诞下子嗣。但他...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910829009:1":{"text":"你只是沉睡，最终撷取了所诞之物的记忆和情感，并自以为慈...","source_cn":"你只是沉睡，最终撷取了所诞之物的记忆和情感，并自以为慈...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910829010:1":{"text":"你说，神也可以改变。那么，试一试吧，奥汐娜，我不希求你...","source_cn":"你说，神也可以改变。那么，试一试吧，奥汐娜，我不希求你...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1910829011:1":{"text":"那些诞生于你的存在，那些海裔